[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5226998588","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122211#issuecomment-5226998588","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122211","id":5226998588,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABN42rPA","user":{"login":"Arecher","id":10502115,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNTAyMTE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10502115?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher","html_url":"https://github.com/Arecher","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Arecher/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-08T16:27:38Z","updated_at":"2026-08-08T17:29:12Z","body":"While a `// {` or `// }` does cause this change in previews, having **a end-of-line comment also causes this behaviour** without it:\n\n<img width=\"792\" height=\"403\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9cf85d1c-0b41-47f8-b337-b4565237537d\" />\n\n\nHowever, for end-of-line comments this seems to ONLY happen if it is on the last line of the fragment function. For brackets, which line is previewed does not matter, as long as it is below the commented bracket.\n\n<img width=\"780\" height=\"520\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/37eb9d62-22e7-48d1-a483-c511b53a5306\" />\n\n<img width=\"742\" height=\"752\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5421ecef-8c5e-435b-8ff6-bc8dd8108c2b\" />\n\n\nThis issue also appears on default values, and is not specific to built-in positional values, like I originally thought. This means the issue is a lot more widespread, and since it completely removes the ability to use ANY shader previews *after* a commented out line that contains a curly-bracket, it's a pretty impactful too.\n\n<img width=\"724\" height=\"266\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/18af6334-72ec-4299-baed-c0fe9f39f0b7\" />\n\n\n`(` and `[` do not cause this issue.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5226998588/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5248378615","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122211#issuecomment-5248378615","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122211","id":5248378615,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABONPm9w","user":{"login":"mukarramarif","id":96686328,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcNQ-A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96686328?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mukarramarif","html_url":"https://github.com/mukarramarif","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mukarramarif/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mukarramarif/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mukarramarif/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mukarramarif/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mukarramarif/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mukarramarif/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mukarramarif/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mukarramarif/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mukarramarif/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-11T02:38:52Z","updated_at":"2026-08-11T02:44:19Z","body":"For this issue, would it have to do with something regarding determination of character in [Dictionary CodeHighlighter::_get_line_syntax_highlighting_impl(int p_line)](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/2f2a9f4cc6ecba0d802c5f4ca46f0d6d4d88a18b/editor/script/syntax_highlighters.cpp#L410)? Specifically here `bool is_char = !is_symbol(str[j]);`\n\nThis is the behavior with `bool is_char = is_symbol(str[j]);`\n\n<img width=\"973\" height=\"658\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/55e72d8c-bc8b-4341-8667-c9ebcbfeab99\" />","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5248378615/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5248544574","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/122211#issuecomment-5248544574","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122211","id":5248544574,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABONZvPg","user":{"login":"kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev","html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/sub